       is examined: _o_f_f_s_e_t is subtracted and the result is multiplied by _s_c_a_l_e
       and divided by 65536.  If the resulting value is less than _b_u_f_s_i_z, then
       the corresponding entry in _b_u_f is incremented.  If _b_u_f is NULL, profil‐
       ing is disabled.

